{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Cooking Accident", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Kitchen Tales", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Inseparable Phrasal Verbs", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use some inseparable phrasal verbs when you give opinions to others when you talk about social activities.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use phrasal verbs when you want to be less formal. They are very common in spoken English.<br/><br/>  Inseparable phrasal verbs cannot be separated. This means that you cannot put a noun between the verb and particle (preposition) as you can do with separable phrasal verbs.<br/><br/>  Example: Separable phrasal verb <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">to look up</span></span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">Can you <span class=\"strong\">look up</span> that word?<br/> Can you <span class=\"strong\">look</span> that word <span class=\"strong\">up</span>?<br/> Can you <span class=\"strong\">look</span> it <span class=\"strong\">up</span>?</span><br/><br/>  Example: Inseparable phrasal verb <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">to go though</span></span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">went through</span></span> a dozen cook books.</span>\t", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Phrasal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">bring on<br/><br/>  live on<br/><br/> bear down<br/><br/>  come up with<br/><br/>  settle on<br/><br/>  go through</span><br/><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">come across<br/><br/>  pass on<br/><br/>  come round<br/><br/>  join in</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cause; make happen<br/><br/>  eat all the time<br/><br/>  push; move quickly toward<br/><br/>  produce; get an idea<br/><br/>  decide on<br/><br/>  look from beginning to end<br/><br/>find by accident<br/><br/>  convey; communicate <br/><br/> visit<br/><br/>  participate\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "We're <span class=\"strong\">bringing on</span> Spicy Rice Night next weekend.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It's like shopping and <span class=\"strong\">coming across</span> those special pieces.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I wanted to <span class=\"strong\">pass on</span> that feeling of sunny afternoons at the beach or relaxing in crowded outdoor cafes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Honestly, they all practically <span class=\"strong\">live off</span> of spicy food! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "As far as I'm concerned, we have <span class=\"strong\">settled on</span> the perfect menu for that!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "To my mind, <span class=\"strong\">coming up with</span> distinctive food is good business.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "To be frank, I <span class=\"strong\">went through</span> dozens of cookbooks.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for Clarification", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details on what the other person is talking about. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You ask for clarification when it is not clear what the other person is referring to. You ask the other person to be more specific by giving you more information. <br/><br/>  You can use a question at the beginning of a statement or question to ask for clarification like: <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense?</span><br/><br/> Questions within sentences are called embedded questions. <br/><br/>  Example: <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Simple question</span>: <span class=\"italic\">What are you going to do after dinner?</span><br/> <span class=\"strong\">Embedded question</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Do you know what you're going to do after dinner?</span><br/><br/>  Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Main Question</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Embedded Question</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you know ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you remember ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You can also use a direct question.<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Example</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Is that a hint?</span><br/><br/>  Direct questions go straight to the point. Sometimes they are used to be light-hearted or to be funny.<br/><br/>  <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: <span class=\"italic\">I'm really hungry now!</span><br/> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: <span class=\"italic\">You mean there are times when you're not?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "How did you know what food to plan for the menu?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Can you tell me why you decided to do it now?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You're saying what you want is to give them a taste of summer?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "So that's where you got the recipes -  from cookbooks?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "So, you looked at recipes to inspire your own?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to bring on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make something happen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We're bringing on Spicy Rice Night next weekend.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about a restaurant event.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "upcoming", "type": "name"}, {"content": "occurring soon", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Vanessa, tell me about your upcoming event.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to live on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to support oneself", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Honestly, they all practically live on spicy food! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fete", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a festival or feast", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: To my mind, coming up with distinctive food and having a winter fete brightens things up.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to bear down", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to exert pressure; to loom", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  As I see it, the colder, grey season is bearing down on us.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to liven up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to stimulate; to energize", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: To my mind, coming up with distinctive food and having a winter fete livens things up.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to settle on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to opt for something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: As far as I'm concerned, we have settled on the perfect menu for that!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to come round", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to visit; to stop in", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Well, it looks like I'll be coming round to participate in the fun!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to join in", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to participate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am eager to join in on the activities.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob03aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to inspire", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to stimulate or motivate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: So, you looked at recipes to inspire your own?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob03aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "In pairs, brainstorm six phrasal verbs you think your classmates will not know.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Research the phrasal verbs definitions, explanations, structures and popularity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Break the pairs up and form small groups.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Teach the group your phrasal verbs while group members take notes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "After, the group votes on the best phrasal verb they learned and why.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I research phrasal verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I understand their meanings and their structures.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I teach phrasal verbs in a clear and concise manner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen for gist and for detail to my group members' phrasal verbs.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le10ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Hello everyone. This morning I'm interviewing Vanessa, the manager at Bistro 88. Vanessa, tell me about your upcoming event.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We're bringing on Spicy Rice Night next weekend, starting at 5:00 on Saturday.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: How do you know what food to plan for the menu?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I talk to our customers regularly. Honestly, they all practically live on spicy food!"}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "22500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Can you tell me why you decided to do it now?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: As I see it, the colder, grey season is bearing down upon us. To my mind, coming up with distinctive food and having a winter fete livens things up.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: You're saying what you want is to give them a taste of summer?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Exactly. As far as I'm concerned, we have settled on the perfect menu for that!"}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob03re2img02.jpg", "time": "43000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: How did you decide what to serve? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: To be frank, I went through dozens of cookbooks.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: So that's where you get the recipes -  from cookbooks?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, but that's where I started. It's like shopping and coming across those special pieces that make a very personal look. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: So, you looked at recipes to inspire your own?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes. I wanted to pass on that feeling of sunny afternoons at the beach or relaxing in crowded outdoor cafes.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Well, it looks like I'll be coming round to join in on the fun!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le10ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le10ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": "<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Hello everyone. This morning I'm interviewing Vanessa, the manager at Bistro 88. Vanessa, tell me about your upcoming event.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We're bringing on Spicy Rice Night next weekend, starting at 5:00 on Saturday.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: How did you know what food to plan for the menu?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I talk to our customers regularly. Honestly, they all practically live on of spicy food!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Can you tell me why you decided to do it now?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: As I see it, the colder, grey season is bearing down on us. To my mind, coming up with distinctive food and having a winter fete livens things up.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: You're saying what you want is to give them a taste of summer?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Exactly. As far as I'm concerned, we have settled on the perfect menu for that!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: How did you decide what to serve? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: To be frank, I went through dozens of cookbooks.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: That's where you got the recipes -  from cookbooks?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, but that's where I started. It's like shopping and coming across those special pieces that make a very personal look. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: So, you looked at recipes to inspire your own?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes. I wanted to pass on that feeling of sunny afternoons at the beach or relaxing in crowded outdoor cafes.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Well, it looks like I'll be coming round to join in on the fun!", "type": "p"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about going out and socializing. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for clarifications. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can explain my opinion.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "How often do you listen to or read interviews?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What type of interviews interest you the most? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{